# Step 1: Website Selection

## Website Information

- **Website Name:** NVIDIA
- **Website URL:**  https://www.nvidia.com/en-us/

## Why I Selected This Website

I selected NVIDIA because I am interested in technology, graphics cards, and artificial intelligence. I also wanted to use a website that I enjoy exploring.

## Features Selected for Testing

### Feature 1: Product Search

I will test the search feature by entering different types of search terms. I want to see how the website responds to valid searches, empty searches, and searches that do not match any products.

### Feature 2: Product Navigation

I will test how users navigate through product categories and product information. I will check whether selecting a product category or product link takes the user to the correct page.

## Testing Approach

I will use black-box testing. This means I will interact with the website as a regular user without looking at the source code.

I will focus on user inputs, actions, website responses, and expected results.